"name":"步玑","evidence":["zhanggu-q-4acf253b0fadb603e733","zhanggu-q-4e6bf5ff89170aad6e55"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu-q-72dd776e7f89a6336198","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-fa0fe4a3ed8ad4520955","layer":"original","quote":"阐不应，据城降晋","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":425,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-4acf253b0fadb603e733","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-6eacaf4bfffaf4f6febd","layer":"original","quote":"子协嗣，统骘所领，加抚军将军。协卒，子玑嗣侯。协弟阐，继业为西陵督；加昭武将军〖4〗，封西亭侯","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":454,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhanggu-q-4e6bf5ff89170aad6e55","section":"chapter-052","block":"b-924121af7bdd349c256c","layer":"original","quote":"凤凰元年，召为绕帐督。阐累世在西陵，猝被征命，自以失职，又惧有谗祸；于是据城降晋，遣玑弟璿诣洛阳为任〖5〗。晋以阐为都督西陵诸军事，卫将军，仪同三司，加侍中，假节，领交州牧，封宜都公〖6〗；玑监江陵诸军事，左将军，加散骑常侍，领（庐陵）〔庐江〕太守，改封江陵侯；璿给事中，宣威将军〖7〗，封都乡侯。命车骑将军羊祜、荆州刺史杨肇，往赴救阐","section_title":"张顾诸葛步传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0111.xhtml","index":455,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":168,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
